    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "\"Gravity, magnetic, and physical property data were collected in the vicinity of the Deep Creek Range, Nevada and Utah, as part of a geophysical assessment of the Goshute Indian Reservation. Together these data can be used as an aid to determine the relationship between geology, gravity anomalies, magnetic anomalies, physical properties, and to model subsurface geologic structure.\"",
